## Features

### Phase 1: MVP (Core)

#### 📊 Dashboard
- Tổng leads / studios / emails sent / reply rate
- Stat cards: Today sent, Total sent, Pending, Replies
- Recent activity log (last 20 actions)

#### 👥 Lead Management
- Table view toàn bộ 553 contacts (sort/filter/search)
- Filter by Tier (1/2/3), Studio, Status (pending/sent/replied/bounced)
- Import CSV (upload `SalesQL_Enriched_Leads.csv`)
- Edit contact info inline

#### 📧 Campaign Control
- **Send** — chọn leads → send ngay hoặc schedule
- **Dry-run** — preview email trước khi gửi
- **Batch send** — chọn limit + auto rate-limiting
- **Template selector** — chọn initial/followup_1/followup_2
- **Email preview** — render template với data contact thật

#### 📋 Sent Log
- Table: timestamp, to, studio, template, status, message_id
- Filter by date/status
- Export CSV

---

### Phase 2: Automation

#### 🔄 Follow-up Engine
- Auto-detect contacts cần followup (3 ngày / 7 ngày sau initial)
- One-click "Send all pending follow-ups"
- Queue system với rate limiting

#### 📬 Reply Detection
- Scan inbox qua Gmail API cho replies từ lead emails
- Auto-mark contact status = "replied"
- Skip follow-ups cho contacts đã reply
- Notification khi có reply mới

#### ⚡ Bounce Detection
- Detect bounce notification emails
- Auto-mark contact status = "bounced"
- Alert nếu bounce rate > 5%

---

### Phase 3: Analytics & Polish

#### 📈 Analytics Dashboard
- Charts: emails/day, reply rate over time, delivery rate
- Funnel: Sent → Opened → Replied → Meeting booked
- Tier performance comparison
- Best day/time analysis

#### 🎨 Template Editor
- Visual template editor trong browser
- Preview on desktop / mobile
- A/B test subject lines

#### 🗄️ Supadase Integration (Optional)
- Migrate từ SQLite → Supadase cho multi-user
- Auth cho team members

