## API Endpoints (Backend)

### Leads
| Method | Endpoint | Mô tả |
|--------|----------|--------|
| GET | `/api/leads` | List all leads (filter/sort/pagination) |
| GET | `/api/leads/{id}` | Get lead detail |
| PUT | `/api/leads/{id}` | Update lead |
| POST | `/api/leads/import` | Import CSV file |
| GET | `/api/leads/stats` | Lead statistics |

### Campaign
| Method | Endpoint | Mô tả |
|--------|----------|--------|
| POST | `/api/campaign/send` | Send batch emails |
| POST | `/api/campaign/dry-run` | Preview batch (no send) |
| POST | `/api/campaign/followup` | Send pending follow-ups |
| GET | `/api/campaign/status` | Campaign statistics |
| GET | `/api/campaign/log` | Sent email log |
| POST | `/api/campaign/test` | Send test to self |

### Templates
| Method | Endpoint | Mô tả |
|--------|----------|--------|
| GET | `/api/templates` | List templates |
| GET | `/api/templates/{name}/preview` | Render preview with sample data |
| PUT | `/api/templates/{name}` | Update template content |

### Inbox
| Method | Endpoint | Mô tả |
|--------|----------|--------|
| POST | `/api/inbox/scan` | Scan for replies & bounces |
| GET | `/api/inbox/replies` | List detected replies |

