## Deployment Plan

### DNS
- Thêm A record: `mail.tdgamestudio.com` → `180.93.144.98` (Megahost_02)

### Nginx Config
```nginx
server {
    server_name mail.tdgamestudio.com;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:3400;  # Next.js frontend
    }

    location /api/ {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:8400;  # FastAPI backend
    }

    # SSL managed by Certbot
}
```

### Systemd Services
- `td-mailer-backend.service` — FastAPI trên port 8400
- `td-mailer-frontend.service` — Next.js trên port 3400

### Security
- Basic Auth hoặc JWT login (chỉ bạn access)
- Gmail token stored server-side
- HTTPS enforced

